                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/path+%E2%88%9E-groupoid"} path ∞-groupoid
                of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diffeological+space"} diffeological space
                = succeed "." do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi X
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
              %p
                In fact, by the discussion at
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/shape+via+cohesive+path+%E2%88%9E-groupoid"} shape via cohesive path ∞-groupoid
                we have that
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
